FoloOS AI Passport

This repository contains an unofficial community-derived firmware for
FoloToy AI Passport. It is not an official FoloToy release and is not
endorsed or supported by FoloToy.

The PC-side Codex bridge is maintained separately:
- https://github.com/Cvencent/CodexBridge

Official upstream projects and documentation:
- https://github.com/FoloToy/ai-passport
- https://github.com/FoloToy/folo-ai-passport-xiaozhi
- https://docs.folotoy.com/zh/docs/web-tool/

